QUICK REVISION
==================================================

PRIMARY KEY
→ Unique and NOT NULL.

COMPOSITE KEY
→ Primary key using multiple columns.

AUTO_INCREMENT
→ Automatically generates numbers.

AUTO_INCREMENT=100
→ Starts numbering from 100.

@@sql_mode
→ Shows current SQL mode.

@@SESSION.sql_mode
→ Shows session SQL mode.
